WEBVTT

00:00.160 --> 00:04.520
Original translation by WolfPack Productions

00:02.820 --> 00:07.670
<i>The legend of the ten warriors who once saved the Digital World...</i>

00:04.520 --> 00:08.520
TLC, editing, timing, typesetting & encoding by PositronCannon

00:07.990 --> 00:10.370
<i>is now reborn.</i>

00:08.520 --> 00:12.520
Additional translations, TLC & QC by Lord Starfish

00:32.940 --> 00:37.740
<b>Kusubutteta mune ni nageirero fire!!</b>

00:32.940 --> 00:37.740
The fire burns in your smoking heart

00:37.740 --> 00:44.000
<b>Chiheisen e kokoro tobasunda</b>

00:37.740 --> 00:44.000
Let your soul fly towards the horizon

00:44.540 --> 00:49.000
<b>Kara mawari no kimochi o keri agetara</b>

00:44.540 --> 00:49.000
Kicking up this entangled feeling

00:49.000 --> 00:53.340
<b>Saki ni iku ze tsugi no furontia</b>

00:49.000 --> 00:53.340
Let's get to the next frontier first

00:54.840 --> 00:57.800
<b>Kanau sa kanau</b>

00:54.840 --> 00:57.800
It will come true, it will

00:57.800 --> 01:00.760
<b>Hakkaten wa mou sugu da ze</b>

00:57.800 --> 01:00.760
The point of ignition is right there

01:00.760 --> 01:03.560
<b>Dekiru dekiru sa</b>

01:00.760 --> 01:03.560
It's possible, it can be done

01:03.560 --> 01:06.560
<b>Bakuhatsu shite miserunda</b>

01:03.560 --> 01:06.560
I'll show you I can explode

01:06.560 --> 01:09.020
<b>Burn up'n go!!</b>

01:06.560 --> 01:09.020
Burn up'n go!!

01:11.230 --> 01:16.650
<b>Gomibako o tobi koeta saki ni aru mirai</b>

01:11.230 --> 01:16.650
Take flight towards the future beyond the trash can

01:17.280 --> 01:21.080
<b>Hikari o matotte get a fire power!!</b>

01:17.280 --> 01:21.080
Gather the light and get a fire power!!

01:22.830 --> 01:28.330
<b>Giragira to moe agare hitomi no chikara</b>

01:22.830 --> 01:28.330
Your eyes burn up with the strength

01:28.790 --> 01:32.800
<b>Kesenai yuuki de get a fire power!!</b>

01:28.790 --> 01:32.800
With unstoppable courage, get a fire power!!

01:33.460 --> 01:38.760
<b>Michi ga michiteru furontia e</b>

01:33.460 --> 01:38.760
To the frontier full of the unknown

01:39.370 --> 01:44.260
<b>Hashiri tsuzukerunda kimi o tsurete</b>

01:39.370 --> 01:44.260
I continue to run, taking you along

01:53.750 --> 01:54.940
Spirit...

01:55.830 --> 01:57.280
Evolution!

02:15.170 --> 02:16.730
Agnimon!

02:18.380 --> 02:21.050
<i>Kanbara Takuya, who had gotten lost in the Digital World,</i>

02:21.050 --> 02:26.270
<i>obtained a Spirit and evolved to Agnimon, a Fire Digimon known as a Legendary Warrior.</i>

02:28.290 --> 02:32.390
<i>He then fought against the violent Cerberumon and defeated him.</i>

02:33.590 --> 02:37.660
<i>However, he had no idea just what had awakened within him,</i>

02:37.660 --> 02:40.490
<i>so Takuya was speechless.</i>

02:54.410 --> 02:56.340
Just what...

02:56.620 --> 03:00.010
You turned into a Digimon.

03:00.500 --> 03:02.780
Me... a Digimon?

03:02.780 --> 03:05.340
You evolved.

03:05.640 --> 03:07.300
Evolved!?

03:07.300 --> 03:09.060
How did I evolve?

03:10.870 --> 03:12.020
Make me evolve!

03:12.980 --> 03:14.520
Show me evolution!

03:20.990 --> 03:23.370
The DigiCode is returning!

03:54.310 --> 03:55.350
What is this?

03:59.320 --> 04:00.640
This is...

04:02.070 --> 04:10.450
<b><i>Wolfmon of Light</i></b>

04:02.070 --> 04:10.450
<b><i>Battle in the Underground Maze!</i></b>

04:03.450 --> 04:07.260
"Wolfmon of Light - Battle in the Underground Maze!"

04:10.900 --> 04:13.980
Yeah! They did it!

04:14.420 --> 04:15.500
Our town!

04:15.500 --> 04:17.380
It's been restored!

04:17.780 --> 04:19.220
I'm Bokomon.

04:19.220 --> 04:23.020
It's all thanks to you obtaining the DigiCode that everything returned!

04:23.020 --> 04:24.150
I'm Neemon.

04:24.150 --> 04:27.050
The land we lost is back as well!

04:27.050 --> 04:29.020
I'm Kanbara Takuya.

04:29.020 --> 04:31.770
What do you mean by the DigiCode returning the land?

04:32.010 --> 04:36.230
The Digital World wasn't always full of holes like it is now.

04:36.780 --> 04:38.290
Um, Izumi-chan.

04:38.290 --> 04:39.440
What?

04:39.440 --> 04:40.980
However...

04:42.540 --> 04:47.450
Cherubimon's powers made a bunch of Digimon go crazy.

04:47.450 --> 04:51.670
That's why a lot of the land in the Digital World is gone.

04:51.670 --> 04:56.200
We need the DigiCode to recover that land!

04:59.710 --> 05:01.500
So with this Digivice...

05:01.500 --> 05:02.460
Hey...

05:02.460 --> 05:05.630
Say, can mine do that too?

05:10.180 --> 05:11.630
What do you think?

05:11.630 --> 05:13.210
I guess it should.

05:14.010 --> 05:15.640
Tomoki, come here for a second.

05:24.070 --> 05:26.420
I'm sick of this world.

05:26.420 --> 05:28.580
Aren't you too, Tomoki?

05:28.580 --> 05:30.490
Yeah, but...

05:30.490 --> 05:32.390
But what?

05:32.390 --> 05:36.150
Takuya-oniichan evolving into a Digimon was really cool!

05:36.150 --> 05:37.460
He was like a hero!

05:37.840 --> 05:39.270
What did you say?

05:39.270 --> 05:42.630
I... I've always wanted to be a hero!

05:42.630 --> 05:44.600
Don't be stupid.

05:44.600 --> 05:47.410
There's nothing cool about being a hero.

05:47.410 --> 05:49.330
It's something really tough.

05:49.330 --> 05:52.420
Besides, weren't you all about going home earlier?

05:53.150 --> 05:55.810
Anyway, humans turning into Digimon or whatever...

05:55.810 --> 05:56.940
I'll pass.

05:56.940 --> 05:59.230
Come on, let's hurry back to our world.

05:59.230 --> 06:02.820
<i>Search for the Spirits and collect them.</i>

06:02.820 --> 06:03.650
Spirits?

06:04.060 --> 06:05.860
<i>Minamoto Koji-kun.</i>

06:06.570 --> 06:11.280
<i>All these mysteries that surround you will be solved one day.</i>

06:11.530 --> 06:13.870
How do you know my name?

06:13.870 --> 06:15.490
Just who are you?

06:16.750 --> 06:19.710
Why did you call me to this world?

06:21.350 --> 06:23.590
What do you want from me?

06:26.840 --> 06:27.760
Huh?

06:40.190 --> 06:43.110
Hey, you! Do you know?

06:44.150 --> 06:47.650
How we can return to the human world, I mean.

06:47.890 --> 06:49.250
Please tell us.

06:49.600 --> 06:50.750
Don't wanna.

06:50.750 --> 06:52.800
So you know.

06:58.580 --> 07:00.620
It's delicious. Don't you want some?

07:02.940 --> 07:05.590
So? If you tell me, I'll give you this.

07:09.870 --> 07:14.550
If you go to the station and ride on the Trailmon called Angler, he'll take you home.

07:14.550 --> 07:15.430
Really?

07:16.250 --> 07:17.640
Why don't you check?

07:17.640 --> 07:18.890
Thanks!

07:22.790 --> 07:24.650
This is delicious!

07:24.650 --> 07:27.520
But I'm sure he's got more...

07:31.190 --> 07:32.950
What are they doing?

07:35.330 --> 07:38.230
Oh well, it's none of my business.

07:38.240 --> 07:40.120
They can just take care of it themselves.

07:42.370 --> 07:45.640
Hey, hey, we want to go back to the human world!

07:45.640 --> 07:46.470
Won't you give us a ride?

07:46.470 --> 07:47.250
Won't you?

07:49.150 --> 07:50.750
I can't do that.

07:51.350 --> 07:53.350
I'll give you this chocolate!

07:53.340 --> 07:56.350
If you send us home safely, I'll give you a lot more of it, too!

08:01.780 --> 08:03.590
Delicious!

08:05.560 --> 08:07.680
Well, with that in mind...

08:12.340 --> 08:13.480
He's gone...

08:13.480 --> 08:14.490
Now what?

08:21.260 --> 08:23.750
Hey, you've got more chocolate, don't you?

08:25.710 --> 08:26.670
No.

08:36.140 --> 08:37.890
Hand them over!

08:44.550 --> 08:46.660
Someone! Help!

09:04.290 --> 09:06.700
This is so nostalgic!

09:06.700 --> 09:10.020
I hadn't been here in so long-puyo!

09:14.590 --> 09:16.540
Hey, where's Tomoki?

09:16.540 --> 09:18.470
Junpei isn't here either.

09:18.470 --> 09:21.170
They're taking a walk, I guess.

09:21.170 --> 09:23.720
This is an unusual village for you humans, isn't it?

09:24.240 --> 09:25.890
I hope it's that...

09:38.080 --> 09:41.160
Tomoki! Junpei!

09:41.760 --> 09:43.370
I wonder what happened.

09:44.630 --> 09:48.710
Hey, Poyomon! Have you seen some human children?

09:48.710 --> 09:50.040
They were at the station!

09:50.040 --> 09:51.760
Some Pagumon were after them!

09:51.760 --> 09:52.540
They went that way!

09:54.140 --> 09:55.510
That's a problem.

09:56.160 --> 09:57.650
Pagumon?

09:57.650 --> 09:59.470
They're Digimon bullies.

10:21.810 --> 10:23.950
Is there something in here?

10:24.300 --> 10:26.330
What's a Spirit anyway?

10:29.860 --> 10:32.460
No, no, no!

10:32.460 --> 10:35.240
Evolve, evolve, evolve, evolve!!

10:35.240 --> 10:36.500
What are you doing?

10:36.510 --> 10:40.260
I want to evolve the way Takuya-oniichan did, and beat them!

10:40.270 --> 10:43.670
Stupid, there's no way you can evolve!

10:43.670 --> 10:45.510
But...

11:07.350 --> 11:09.020
Let's run away, Tomoki!

11:09.290 --> 11:11.390
Tomoki! Junpei!

11:11.390 --> 11:12.750
Where are you?

11:12.750 --> 11:14.170
Oh...?

11:14.170 --> 11:16.280
I didn't know things looked like this over here...

11:16.280 --> 11:17.790
What a surprise...

11:17.790 --> 11:19.300
Really.

11:20.300 --> 11:23.020
Let's go after those two.

11:23.020 --> 11:24.680
Oh, go after them?

11:25.030 --> 11:26.830
Seriously, where are they?

11:26.830 --> 11:30.680
I feel sorry for Tomoki, he doesn't want to be here...

11:30.680 --> 11:34.180
He must only be in third grade or so...

11:34.180 --> 11:36.430
I'll definitely take him back home.

11:36.750 --> 11:39.070
Look at you, trying to be an adult.

11:39.560 --> 11:41.120
I'm in fifth grade!

11:41.120 --> 11:42.400
I'm older than him.

11:43.440 --> 11:46.500
So we're the same age? Come on...

11:48.010 --> 11:50.790
I thought you were younger than me.

11:51.260 --> 11:53.250
I'll be 11 years old soon!

11:53.740 --> 11:55.210
On which month?

11:55.210 --> 11:56.210
August.

11:57.110 --> 11:59.820
So I am older after all.

11:59.820 --> 12:03.010
My birthday's in May, so I'm three months older.

12:04.970 --> 12:06.230
It doesn't matter.

12:09.360 --> 12:10.450
This is...

12:11.060 --> 12:12.690
It's that boy's... Tomoki's!

12:16.900 --> 12:18.400
Should we fall now?

12:21.240 --> 12:23.390
Ugh, that hurt!

12:23.390 --> 12:25.710
What are you doing?

12:27.410 --> 12:28.490
Nooo!

12:28.490 --> 12:29.680
Get away!

12:30.980 --> 12:34.420
What's that for!? Weren't you the one grabbing on to me!?

12:34.680 --> 12:36.700
You don't have to address me like that!

12:34.680 --> 12:39.600
Note: Takuya uses "omae", which can be considered a rude form of "you".

12:36.700 --> 12:39.600
I have a lovely name, Orimoto Izumi!

12:40.450 --> 12:42.590
So you say it's lovely yourself?

12:43.050 --> 12:45.550
So what? I like my name!

12:45.540 --> 12:48.380
Anyway, shouldn't we look for the others first?

12:49.860 --> 12:52.060
Are they in here?

13:14.380 --> 13:16.350
The wind is coming from there.

13:16.350 --> 13:18.460
If we go this way we'll get to the exit.

13:18.460 --> 13:19.560
Hey, hey...

13:19.560 --> 13:20.640
What?

13:20.640 --> 13:23.180
Haven't we been here before?

13:23.180 --> 13:24.340
I don't think so.

13:24.720 --> 13:26.020
But...

13:26.020 --> 13:27.070
Look.

13:28.360 --> 13:29.800
What's this?

13:30.190 --> 13:31.760
I drew it a while ago.

13:31.760 --> 13:33.410
What!?

13:33.410 --> 13:36.220
We got lost...

13:36.220 --> 13:38.570
We've been lost for a while.

13:39.680 --> 13:41.330
Don't cry...

13:41.330 --> 13:43.400
I'll feel like crying too.

13:45.060 --> 13:46.220
Eat.

13:49.360 --> 13:52.160
Anyway, we have to get out of this cave.

13:58.330 --> 13:59.970
Here they are!

14:09.090 --> 14:11.890
They smell of chocolate...

14:11.890 --> 14:14.080
They must be delicious, so let's eat them!

14:18.980 --> 14:20.190
This is...

14:20.190 --> 14:23.190
Help!

14:26.550 --> 14:28.560
Help!

14:28.560 --> 14:29.950
Tomoki and Junpei!

14:29.950 --> 14:31.160
Let's hurry!

14:31.160 --> 14:32.500
Obviously.

14:41.210 --> 14:43.170
Stop it!

14:48.470 --> 14:50.220
You're not getting in the way!

15:00.130 --> 15:01.410
He's strong!

15:01.410 --> 15:02.700
Who is he?

15:02.700 --> 15:04.400
And why is he here?

15:26.340 --> 15:28.090
You bastard...

15:28.090 --> 15:30.300
I'll melt you!

15:41.590 --> 15:43.560
I'll eat you...

15:43.560 --> 15:44.360
Damn it!

15:45.730 --> 15:48.070
Raremon, Undead Digimon.

15:48.070 --> 15:50.490
His muscles are muddy and rotten.

15:50.490 --> 15:53.200
His special attack is the horribly stinky Sludge!

16:04.880 --> 16:06.740
Get them, Raremon!

16:07.150 --> 16:08.620
It stinks!

16:08.620 --> 16:10.340
Spirit, awaken!

16:12.590 --> 16:14.760
Why can't I evolve!?

16:15.450 --> 16:16.260
Huh?

16:16.260 --> 16:17.800
Huh? Huh? Huh?

16:17.800 --> 16:21.610
You mean you can't use the Spirit, Takuya-han?

16:24.090 --> 16:25.840
Please...!

16:29.940 --> 16:32.620
Go to hell!

16:32.620 --> 16:34.430
Spirit!!

16:43.810 --> 16:45.040
Spirit...

16:46.100 --> 16:47.640
Evolution!

17:05.640 --> 17:07.180
Agnimon!

17:18.260 --> 17:19.950
Now's your chance! Get away!

17:27.180 --> 17:29.460
Huh? I changed back?

17:34.550 --> 17:37.260
Melt!

17:37.270 --> 17:38.680
Watch out!

17:39.810 --> 17:40.890
Dammit!

17:56.240 --> 17:57.450
A Spirit?

18:10.260 --> 18:12.710
Spirit!

18:31.790 --> 18:32.980
Spirit...

18:33.810 --> 18:35.300
Evolution!

18:53.950 --> 18:55.590
Wolfmon!

18:55.610 --> 19:00.430
<b>Kaze wo ukete tatsu kewashii gake de wa</b>

18:55.610 --> 19:00.430
Standing at a steep cliff and feeling the wind

19:01.020 --> 19:05.720
<b>Jibun no yowasa bakari ga mieru ne</b>

19:01.020 --> 19:05.720
You can't see anything but your own weakness

19:04.510 --> 19:05.720
Awesome!

19:05.990 --> 19:08.060
Was it like that for me?

19:06.660 --> 19:11.520
<b>Demo donna pinchi mo haruka e toberu</b>

19:06.660 --> 19:11.520
But any pinch we encounter conceals a miracle

19:08.520 --> 19:09.770
It happened again!

19:12.190 --> 19:17.110
<b>chansu ni mo kawaru kiseki kakushimotteru</b>

19:12.190 --> 19:17.110
that can turn into a chance to fly away from here

19:15.160 --> 19:17.110
A... a legendary warrior...

19:17.110 --> 19:19.340
Wolfmon of Light!

19:17.430 --> 19:22.740
<b>Densetsu ni wa musuu no hiiroo</b>

19:17.430 --> 19:22.740
There are countless heroes in the legends

19:22.580 --> 19:24.290
Legendary warrior?

19:23.380 --> 19:28.510
<b>Esoragoto to itterarenai</b>

19:23.380 --> 19:28.510
You can't say it's just a pipe dream

19:24.290 --> 19:25.040
Of light?

19:25.570 --> 19:26.770
Wolfmon?

19:26.770 --> 19:28.550
Melt away!

19:29.200 --> 19:34.880
<b>Toushi ni ima akari wo tomose wakatteiru sa</b>

19:29.200 --> 19:34.880
Now, light a torch within the warriors. I know that

19:29.540 --> 19:31.300
Licht Sieger!

19:34.880 --> 19:40.550
<b>ichiban tegowai aite wa kokoro ni irun da</b>

19:34.880 --> 19:40.550
the most frightening opponent is in my heart

19:40.550 --> 19:43.670
<b>Furimukanai nigetari shinai</b>

19:40.550 --> 19:43.670
I won't turn back, and I won't run away

19:44.590 --> 19:50.150
<b>Tochuu no mama de me wo sorashiteta yume e to</b>

19:44.590 --> 19:50.150
I'll go to the dream I averted my eyes from along the way

19:44.720 --> 19:46.890
Soul that squirms in darkness...

19:50.150 --> 19:52.390
<b>Tobikome With The Will</b>

19:50.150 --> 19:52.390
I'll dive right in, With The Will

19:52.490 --> 19:54.990
The holy light will purify you!

19:58.190 --> 20:00.650
DigiCode Scan!

20:10.070 --> 20:11.750
Commozione!

20:21.010 --> 20:22.300
Are you okay?

20:22.300 --> 20:23.670
Sorry about before.

20:24.650 --> 20:26.090
Don't touch me.

20:26.930 --> 20:30.100
I hate it when strangers touch me.

20:32.410 --> 20:35.140
Still, I'll thank you for helping me out.

20:35.480 --> 20:37.270
I'll return the favor for sure.

20:37.270 --> 20:39.070
I'm not asking you to.

20:39.660 --> 20:41.590
I'm Minamoto Koji.

20:41.590 --> 20:42.700
And you?

20:44.210 --> 20:47.830
How can I return the favor if I don't know your name?

20:48.360 --> 20:49.660
It's Kanbara Takuya.

20:50.480 --> 20:51.770
Takuya, huh?

20:52.590 --> 20:53.390
See you again.

20:54.200 --> 20:55.520
What a weirdo.

20:55.520 --> 20:57.560
Hey, let's hurry and get out.

20:57.540 --> 20:59.340
The air here is awful.

21:04.770 --> 21:07.070
I evolved into a Digimon...

21:07.670 --> 21:09.620
This is getting interesting.

21:11.080 --> 21:18.060
<b>Donna ni hanarete itemo...</b>

21:11.080 --> 21:18.060
No matter how far apart we are...

21:27.360 --> 21:34.660
<b>Miageta sora kimi wa tooi basho de</b>

21:27.360 --> 21:34.660
Looking up at the sky, you are far away

21:35.500 --> 21:37.800
<b>Onaji keshiki</b>

21:35.500 --> 21:37.800
I wonder if

21:39.590 --> 21:42.590
<b>mitsumete iru no ka na</b>

21:39.590 --> 21:42.590
you're looking at the same scenery?

21:43.710 --> 21:47.050
<b>Todokanai</b>

21:43.710 --> 21:47.050
The feelings

21:47.680 --> 21:50.010
<b>omoi o</b>

21:47.680 --> 21:50.010
that won't reach you

21:50.430 --> 21:54.890
<b>Mune ni kizamitsuke hashittetanda</b>

21:50.430 --> 21:54.890
I engrave them in my heart and run

21:54.890 --> 22:01.770
<b>Bokutachi ga yumemita ashita ni</b>

21:54.890 --> 22:01.770
The tomorrow that we dreamed of

22:01.770 --> 22:04.490
<b>Hibiku yo</b>

22:01.770 --> 22:04.490
Your laughter

22:04.490 --> 22:08.950
<b>kimi no warai goe</b>

22:04.490 --> 22:08.950
echoes in it

22:09.490 --> 22:10.870
<b>Dakara</b>

22:09.490 --> 22:10.870
So

22:10.870 --> 22:17.620
<b>bokutachi ga atarashii kaze o</b>

22:10.870 --> 22:17.620
Let's create a new wind

22:17.620 --> 22:26.520
<b>Okosou mujaki na mama de</b>

22:17.620 --> 22:26.520
Remaining innocent

22:38.020 --> 22:40.650
No! I don't want to get in the others' way!

22:40.650 --> 22:44.270
Agnimon's fire can't hurt those Candmon?

22:44.270 --> 22:45.570
Watch out, Agnimon!

22:45.570 --> 22:47.090
Can't we do anything?

22:47.090 --> 22:49.320
Tomoki, you run away!

22:49.320 --> 22:51.070
Please, give me the power!

22:51.070 --> 22:52.700
Spirit Evolution!

22:53.180 --> 22:55.340
Next time, on Digimon Frontier!

22:55.340 --> 22:59.120
"I Won't Allow Bullying! Evolve Into Chakmon of Ice"

22:56.120 --> 22:59.120
<b>I Won't Allow Bullying!</b>

22:56.120 --> 22:59.120
<b>Evolve Into Chakmon of Ice</b>

22:59.120 --> 23:01.690
Now, the legend evolves.
